.TH AVR\-TESTS\-VIEW 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-tests-view \- Open a saved exact result reference from avr tests JOB --json data.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr tests view
[OPTIONS] RESULT
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open a saved exact result reference from avr tests JOB --json data.
.PP
Reruns never substitute a newer result. Expired reports return an explicit status; deleted or inaccessible results fail the command. Use --repo when opening a result outside its repository checkout.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIRESULT\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Defaults to the configured organization.
.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fITEXT\fR
Repository (owner/name or rep-ID). Defaults to AVR_REPO or the current checkout.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-tests (1),
.BR avr-tests-list (1)
